// Handwritten lines of the thirteen anchors (spec §13). Each anchor has >= 40 lines in the seven categories; they
// name each other and the shared state (the customs supervisor, Brin's bill with Tessa, Seli's missing regular, Ilen's
// committee, Asha's proposal, Seran's investigation, Koro's gate, Ral's respectable clients). Format per line:
// [category, text, when?, opts?] - `when` is evaluated by dialog/api.js against the real context, so a claim about a
// shortage, a Senate result or a docked ship is only said when it is true; `opts.rumor` marks hearsay, `opts.trigger`
// overrides the trigger ('interrupt'). Fills: the person's own {place}/{home}/... from bank.buildFills plus
// {rel_<kind>} (the name of the related person of that kind), {rel_<kind>_place}, and the live tokens
// {senateScenario} {disaster} {jobTitle} {stockQty} {price}.
